<article itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork" itemscope="itemscope" id="post-7390" class="post-7390 page type-page status-publish ast-article-single">

	
	<header class="entry-header ast-header-without-markup">

		
			</header><!-- .entry-header -->

	<div class="entry-content clear" itemprop="text">

		
		
<h2>Benefits</h2>



<h3>Competitive Trading and Access Costs</h3>



<p>The BSE offers competitive fee structures for a wide geographical user base – a key factor in a competitive client environment.</p>



<div style="height:50px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h3>Access to Diversified Asset-Class Trading</h3>



<p>With 5 markets offering a myriad of financial products, the BSE offers a multi-asset trading environment that supports the investment and risk management requirements of your clients.</p>



<div style="height:50px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h3>International Trading Environment</h3>



<p>Barbados is the only low-tax wealth management jurisdiction in the Caribbean with a comprehensive tax-treaty network. With this in mind, the ISM was created to offer reciprocal interaction opportunities for both clients and brokers – irrespective of location.</p>



<div style="height:50px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<h3>“Qualifies” Business</h3>



<p>By listing with the Barbados Stock Exchange, issuers demonstrate sufficient confidence in their operations as ongoing entities – an invaluable signal to investors that they can transact in good faith.</p>



<div style="height:40px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<hr class="wp-block-separator is-style-dots"/>



<div style="height:20px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p><strong>To learn more on the roles of Members, please consult the following resources:</strong></p>



<ul><li><a rel="noopener noreferrer" href="http://bse.com.bb/wp-content/uploads/2018/02/ISM-Membership-Roles.pdf" target="_blank"><strong>Member Roles</strong></a></li><li><strong><a rel="noreferrer noopener" aria-label=" (opens in a new tab)" href="http://bse.com.bb/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Rules-of-the-Barbados-Stock-Exchange-Inc.-Version-2.3-202507.pdf" target="_blank">Rules of the Barbados Stock Exchange Inc.</a></strong></li><li><strong><a href="http://bse.com.bb/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Rules-of-the-International-Securities-Market-ISM-Version-7-–-2025-07-14.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" aria-label=" (opens in a new tab)">Rules of the International Securities Market of the Barbados Stock Exchange.</a></strong></li></ul>

		
		
	</div><!-- .entry-content .clear -->

	
	
</article><!-- #post-## -->


					
					
				
			</main><!-- #main -->
			
		
	</div><!-- #primary -->


	
